SUMMARY:Live at Motorco: Dead Calm
DESCRIPTION:Dead Calm is a band from Liam McCay… a young\, prolific Irish musician from County Donegal\, known for creating music under numerous aliases\, most notably Sign Crushes Motorist\, Dead Calm\, and Take Care\, exploring genres like slowcore and indie rock with poignant\, introspective\, and often melancholic themes\, gaining significant online traction while maintaining a low-key\, hobbyist approach to his rapidly growing career. He began with the fiddle\, pivoted to guitar during the pandemic\, and has since released extensive work\, even turning down record deals to keep his creative process personal.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/live-at-motorco-dead-calm/
