SUMMARY:PawPaw Rod: The Picture Day Tour
DESCRIPTION:PawPaw Rod is a Hawaii-born\, Oklahoma-raised rapper and singer known for seamlessly merging hip-hop\, 60s soul\, funk\, and alternative into a genre-fluid sound all his own. Since his breakout single “HIT EM WHERE IT HURTS” in 2020\, Rod has released four EPs\, amassing over 200M streams and critical acclaim from outlets including Complex\, FADER\, GQ\, and Rolling Stone. His music has been featured in Netflix’s Outer Banks\, Apple TV+’s Platonic\, and campaigns for Apple\, Nike\, and GAP. Festival highlights include Coachella\, Lollapalooza\, and Austin City Limits. Rod is currently in the studio working on his debut album. \nPawPaw Rod Picture Day VIP Package :\n– One general admission ticket\n– Early entry into the venue\n– Exclusive meet & greet with PawPaw Rod\n– It’s Picture Day: personal polaroid photograph with PawPaw Rod\n– Specially designed PawPaw Rod tote bag\n– Custom Picture Day slip mat\n– Official meet & greet VIP laminate and lanyard\, autographed by PawPaw Rod\n– Priority merchandise shopping\n– Limited availability
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/pawpaw-rod-the-picture-day-tour/
LOCATION:723 Rigsbee Avenue Durham North Carolina\, 723 Rigsbee Avenue\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Live Performance,Music
